{
  "book": "1nephi",
  "bookName": "1 Nephi",
  "chapter": 14,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 467.336,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.904,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass,",
      "verse": "14:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 2.084,
      "end": 5.428,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if the Gentiles shall hearken unto the Lamb of God",
      "verse": "14:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 5.608,
      "end": 9.323,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in that day that he shall manifest himself unto them",
      "verse": "14:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 9.503,
      "end": 10.618,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in word,",
      "verse": "14:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 10.798,
      "end": 12.238,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also in power,",
      "verse": "14:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 12.418,
      "end": 16.226,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in very deed, unto the taking away of their stumbling blocks\u2014",
      "verse": "14:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 16.906,
      "end": 19.925,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And harden not their hearts against the Lamb of God,",
      "verse": "14:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 20.105,
      "end": 23.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall be numbered among the seed of thy father;",
      "verse": "14:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 23.536,
      "end": 26.926,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they shall be numbered among the house of Israel;",
      "verse": "14:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 27.106,
      "end": 30.868,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall be a blessed people upon the promised land forever;",
      "verse": "14:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 31.048,
      "end": 34.067,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall be no more brought down into captivity;",
      "verse": "14:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 34.247,
      "end": 36.848,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the house of Israel shall no more be confounded.",
      "verse": "14:2",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 37.528,
      "end": 43.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And that great pit, which hath been digged for them by that great and abominable church,",
      "verse": "14:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 43.838,
      "end": 47.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was founded by the devil and his children,",
      "verse": "14:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 47.222,
      "end": 50.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might lead away the souls of men down to hell\u2014",
      "verse": "14:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 50.839,
      "end": 55.855,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, that great pit which hath been digged for the destruction of men",
      "verse": "14:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 56.035,
      "end": 60.493,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be filled by those who digged it, unto their utter destruction,",
      "verse": "14:3",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 60.673,
      "end": 62.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lamb of God;",
      "verse": "14:3",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 62.664,
      "end": 64.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not the destruction of the soul,",
      "verse": "14:3",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 64.98,
      "end": 68.649,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it be the casting of it into that hell which hath no end.",
      "verse": "14:3",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 69.329,
      "end": 74.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, this is according to the captivity of the devil,",
      "verse": "14:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 74.246,
      "end": 76.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also according to the justice of God,",
      "verse": "14:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 76.98,
      "end": 81.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "upon all those who will work wickedness and abomination before him.",
      "verse": "14:4",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 82.072,
      "end": 86.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the angel spake unto me, Nephi, saying:",
      "verse": "14:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 86.246,
      "end": 89.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou hast beheld that if the Gentiles repent",
      "verse": "14:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 89.677,
      "end": 91.488,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it shall be well with them;",
      "verse": "14:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 91.668,
      "end": 97.287,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou also knowest concerning the covenants of the Lord unto the house of Israel;",
      "verse": "14:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 97.467,
      "end": 101.368,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou also hast heard that whoso repenteth not must perish.",
      "verse": "14:5",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 102.048,
      "end": 104.324,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, wo be unto the Gentiles",
      "verse": "14:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 104.504,
      "end": 108.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if it so be that they harden their hearts against the Lamb of God.",
      "verse": "14:6",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 109.364,
      "end": 112.104,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the time cometh, saith the Lamb of God,",
      "verse": "14:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 112.284,
      "end": 116.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I will work a great and a marvelous work among the children of men;",
      "verse": "14:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 116.736,
      "end": 118.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a work which shall be everlasting,",
      "verse": "14:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 119.145,
      "end": 121.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "either on the one hand or on the other\u2014",
      "verse": "14:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 121.647,
      "end": 125.594,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "either to the convincing of them unto peace and life eternal,",
      "verse": "14:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 125.774,
      "end": 129.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or unto the deliverance of them to the hardness of their hearts",
      "verse": "14:7",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 129.855,
      "end": 132.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the blindness of their minds",
      "verse": "14:7",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 132.264,
      "end": 135.515,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto their being brought down into captivity,",
      "verse": "14:7",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 135.695,
      "end": 137.553,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also into destruction,",
      "verse": "14:7",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 137.733,
      "end": 143.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both temporally and spiritually, according to the captivity of the devil,",
      "verse": "14:7",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 143.857,
      "end": 145.297,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of which I have spoken.",
      "verse": "14:7",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 145.977,
      "end": 150.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when the angel had spoken these words, he said unto me:",
      "verse": "14:8",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 151.173,
      "end": 155.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Rememberest thou the covenants of the Father unto the house of Israel?",
      "verse": "14:8",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 155.858,
      "end": 157.344,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I said unto him,",
      "verse": "14:8",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 157.524,
      "end": 158.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea.",
      "verse": "14:8",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 158.947,
      "end": 161.362,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he said unto me:",
      "verse": "14:9",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 161.542,
      "end": 162.471,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Look,",
      "verse": "14:9",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 162.651,
      "end": 165.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold that great and abominable church,",
      "verse": "14:9",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 165.664,
      "end": 168.265,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is the mother of abominations,",
      "verse": "14:9",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 168.445,
      "end": 170.442,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose founder is the devil.",
      "verse": "14:9",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 171.122,
      "end": 172.562,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto me:",
      "verse": "14:10",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 172.742,
      "end": 175.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold there are save two churches only;",
      "verse": "14:10",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 175.476,
      "end": 178.03,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the one is the church of the Lamb of God,",
      "verse": "14:10",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 178.21,
      "end": 180.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the other is the church of the devil;",
      "verse": "14:10",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 180.758,
      "end": 184.705,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, whoso belongeth not to the church of the Lamb of God",
      "verse": "14:10",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 184.885,
      "end": 187.068,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "belongeth to that great church,",
      "verse": "14:10",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 187.248,
      "end": 189.616,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is the mother of abominations;",
      "verse": "14:10",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 189.796,
      "end": 192.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and she is the whore of all the earth.",
      "verse": "14:10",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 192.705,
      "end": 194.981,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I looked",
      "verse": "14:11",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 195.161,
      "end": 197.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and beheld the whore of all the earth,",
      "verse": "14:11",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 197.756,
      "end": 200.078,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and she sat upon many waters;",
      "verse": "14:11",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 200.258,
      "end": 206.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and she had dominion over all the earth, among all nations, kindreds, tongues, and people.",
      "verse": "14:11",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 207.022,
      "end": 211.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I beheld the church of the Lamb of God,",
      "verse": "14:12",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 211.242,
      "end": 219.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and its numbers were few, because of the wickedness and abominations of the whore who sat upon many waters;",
      "verse": "14:12",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 219.967,
      "end": 224.657,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, I beheld that the church of the Lamb, who were the saints of God,",
      "verse": "14:12",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 224.837,
      "end": 227.716,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were also upon all the face of the earth;",
      "verse": "14:12",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 227.896,
      "end": 235.326,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their dominions upon the face of the earth were small, because of the wickedness of the great whore whom I saw.",
      "verse": "14:12",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 236.006,
      "end": 240.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I beheld that the great mother of abominations",
      "verse": "14:13",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 240.366,
      "end": 247.146,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did gather together multitudes upon the face of all the earth, among all the nations of the Gentiles,",
      "verse": "14:13",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 247.326,
      "end": 249.648,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to fight against the Lamb of God.",
      "verse": "14:13",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 250.328,
      "end": 258.362,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I, Nephi, beheld the power of the Lamb of God, that it descended upon the saints of the church of the Lamb,",
      "verse": "14:14",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 258.542,
      "end": 261.375,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and upon the covenant people of the Lord,",
      "verse": "14:14",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 261.555,
      "end": 264.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were scattered upon all the face of the earth;",
      "verse": "14:14",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 264.939,
      "end": 266.936,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were armed with righteousness",
      "verse": "14:14",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 267.116,
      "end": 269.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and with the power of God in great glory.",
      "verse": "14:14",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 270.025,
      "end": 273.322,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I beheld that the wrath of God",
      "verse": "14:15",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 273.502,
      "end": 277.264,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "was poured out upon that great and abominable church,",
      "verse": "14:15",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 277.444,
      "end": 284.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that there were wars and rumors of wars among all the nations and kindreds of the earth.",
      "verse": "14:15",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 285.369,
      "end": 292.753,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as there began to be wars and rumors of wars among all the nations which belonged to the mother of abominations,",
      "verse": "14:16",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 292.933,
      "end": 295.069,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the angel spake unto me, saying:",
      "verse": "14:16",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 295.249,
      "end": 298.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, the wrath of God is upon the mother of harlots;",
      "verse": "14:16",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 298.819,
      "end": 301.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, thou seest all these things\u2014",
      "verse": "14:16",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 301.775,
      "end": 304.329,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when the day cometh that the wrath of God",
      "verse": "14:17",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 304.509,
      "end": 307.203,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "is poured out upon the mother of harlots,",
      "verse": "14:17",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 307.383,
      "end": 311.47,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is the great and abominable church of all the earth,",
      "verse": "14:17",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 311.65,
      "end": 313.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose founder is the devil,",
      "verse": "14:17",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 313.827,
      "end": 315.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then, at that day,",
      "verse": "14:17",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 315.865,
      "end": 321.67,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the work of the Father shall commence, in preparing the way for the fulfilling of his covenants,",
      "verse": "14:17",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 321.85,
      "end": 325.983,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he hath made to his people who are of the house of Israel.",
      "verse": "14:17",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 326.663,
      "end": 330.1,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the angel spake unto me, saying:",
      "verse": "14:18",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 330.28,
      "end": 331.069,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Look!",
      "verse": "14:18",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 331.749,
      "end": 334.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I looked and beheld a man,",
      "verse": "14:19",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 334.205,
      "end": 336.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he was dressed in a white robe.",
      "verse": "14:19",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 337.207,
      "end": 338.74,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the angel said unto me:",
      "verse": "14:20",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 338.92,
      "end": 341.614,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold one of the twelve apostles of the Lamb.",
      "verse": "14:20",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 342.294,
      "end": 344.57,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, he shall see and write",
      "verse": "14:21",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 344.75,
      "end": 346.608,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the remainder of these things;",
      "verse": "14:21",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 346.788,
      "end": 349.435,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and also many things which have been.",
      "verse": "14:21",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 350.115,
      "end": 353.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he shall also write concerning the end of the world.",
      "verse": "14:22",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 353.767,
      "end": 357.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the things which he shall write are just and true;",
      "verse": "14:23",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 358.127,
      "end": 360.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold they are written in the book",
      "verse": "14:23",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 361.093,
      "end": 364.204,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which thou beheld proceeding out of the mouth of the Jew;",
      "verse": "14:23",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 364.384,
      "end": 368.331,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and at the time they proceeded out of the mouth of the Jew,",
      "verse": "14:23",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 368.511,
      "end": 372.691,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or, at the time the book proceeded out of the mouth of the Jew,",
      "verse": "14:23",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 372.871,
      "end": 375.89,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the things which were written were plain and pure,",
      "verse": "14:23",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 376.07,
      "end": 379.46,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and most precious and easy to the understanding of all men.",
      "verse": "14:23",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 380.14,
      "end": 381.394,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold,",
      "verse": "14:24",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 381.574,
      "end": 384.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the things which this apostle of the Lamb shall write",
      "verse": "14:24",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 384.819,
      "end": 386.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are many things which thou hast seen;",
      "verse": "14:24",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 387.135,
      "end": 389.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, the remainder shalt thou see.",
      "verse": "14:24",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 390.183,
      "end": 394.177,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But the things which thou shalt see hereafter thou shalt not write;",
      "verse": "14:25",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 394.357,
      "end": 398.397,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord God hath ordained the apostle of the Lamb of God",
      "verse": "14:25",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 398.577,
      "end": 400.063,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he should write them.",
      "verse": "14:25",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 400.743,
      "end": 402.879,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also others who have been,",
      "verse": "14:26",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 403.059,
      "end": 405.195,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to them hath he shown all things,",
      "verse": "14:26",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 405.375,
      "end": 407.279,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they have written them;",
      "verse": "14:26",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 407.459,
      "end": 409.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are sealed up",
      "verse": "14:26",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 409.264,
      "end": 417.902,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to come forth in their purity, according to the truth which is in the Lamb, in the own due time of the Lord, unto the house of Israel.",
      "verse": "14:26",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 418.582,
      "end": 427.824,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, Nephi, heard and bear record, that the name of the apostle of the Lamb was John, according to the word of the angel.",
      "verse": "14:27",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 428.504,
      "end": 432.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, I, Nephi, am forbidden that I should write",
      "verse": "14:28",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 432.306,
      "end": 435.139,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the remainder of the things which I saw and heard;",
      "verse": "14:28",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 435.319,
      "end": 438.43,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore the things which I have written sufficeth me;",
      "verse": "14:28",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 438.61,
      "end": 442.604,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I have written but a small part of the things which I saw.",
      "verse": "14:28",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 443.284,
      "end": 444.956,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I bear record",
      "verse": "14:29",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 445.136,
      "end": 447.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I saw the things which my father saw,",
      "verse": "14:29",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 447.638,
      "end": 450.657,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the angel of the Lord did make them known unto me.",
      "verse": "14:29",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 451.337,
      "end": 455.656,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I make an end of speaking concerning the things which I saw",
      "verse": "14:30",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 455.836,
      "end": 458.297,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "while I was carried away in the Spirit;",
      "verse": "14:30",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 458.477,
      "end": 461.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if all the things which I saw are not written,",
      "verse": "14:30",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 461.443,
      "end": 464.044,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the things which I have written are true.",
      "verse": "14:30",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 464.224,
      "end": 465.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus it is.",
      "verse": "14:30",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 465.844,
      "end": 466.68,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "14:30",
      "lineIndex": 135
    }
  ]
}